Departure Mono is a monospace font with a lo-fi, pixelated look,
inspired by the bitmap type of early computer terminals and the
technical documentation of the era.

Version 1.500 covers 1,186 glyphs, including Basic Latin, Latin-1,
Latin Extended-A, Cyrillic, Basic Greek, small caps, old-style
numerals and fractions, and simple box-drawing characters.
